{"data":{"__type":{"kind":"ENUM","name":"InterstitialButtonAction","description":null,"fields":null,"inputFields":null,"interfaces":null,"enumValues":[{"name":"CONTINUE_BROWSING","description":"Dismiss the interstitial and continue browsing.\nClient should close the interstitial without any authentication changes.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"CONTINUE_TO_PRO_SIGNUP","description":"Pro signup button on the second Pro PAP → AAP conversion interstitial\n(SHOW_PRO_PAP_TO_AAP_CONVERSION second variant). Client performs the cookie swap and\nnavigates to /signup/pro/start?pap_cnvrt=<value> to begin the Pro signup flow.\npap_cnvrt is a base64-encoded string in the same format as the siteState value on an\nAuthPortal sign-in URL.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"CONTINUE_WITH_IMDB","description":"\"Continue with IMDb\" button on the SHOW_AMAZON_ACCOUNT_IN_USE_INTERSTITIAL error interstitial.\nClient calls recordAmazonAccountPoolConversionDecline(reason: AMAZON_ACCOUNT_IN_USE) →\n120-day TTL before PAP sign-in completes. The Amazon account entered during conversion is\nalready linked to a different IMDb account.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"CONVERT_LWA_TO_AAP","description":"Convert an IMDb account that has existing LWA linkage to the authenticated Amazon account.\nClient should call conversion mutation with just the Amazon token.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"CONVERT_TO_AAP","description":"Convert the authenticated IMDb account to the authenticated Amazon account.\nClient should call conversion mutation with both tokens.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"CREATE_NEW_ACCOUNT","description":"Create new IMDb account using authenticated Amazon account.\nClient should proceed with new account creation.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"DECLINE_CONVERSION","description":"Decline the PAP-to-AAP conversion offer.\nClient should record the decline (60-day TTL) and complete sign-in normally.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"INITIATE_CONVERSION","description":"Home page banner \"Get started\" button.\nNavigates to /registration/conversion/?conversionMode=INITIATE, bypassing the TTL check.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"LINK_IMDB_ACCOUNT","description":"Start IMDb account linking process.\nClient should initiate the IMDb authentication flow for linking.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"LINK_IMDB_ACCOUNT_EMAIL_PREFILLED","description":"Start IMDb account linking process.\nClient should initiate the IMDb authentication flow for linking with a prefilled email.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SHOW_SIGN_IN_OPTIONS","description":"Return user to sign-in options.\nClient should navigate to the main sign-in options page/screen.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_AMAZON","description":"Redirect user to Amazon (AAP) sign-in flow.\nClient should navigate to the Sign in with Amazon page/screen.\nUsed for standard Amazon account authentication.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_AMAZON_LINKING","description":"Redirect user to Amazon linking sign-in flow.\nClient should navigate to the platform-appropriate imdb_amazon_linking association handle.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_APPLE","description":"3P deprecation interstitial primary button. Web and iOS only.\nApple sign-in is not supported on Android — this value is never returned for Android handles.\nReturned on SHOW_3P_DEPRECATION_INTERSTITIAL for imdb_apple (web) and imdb_mobile_ios_apple (iOS).\nClient routes to AuthPortal / MAP SDK with the platform-appropriate Apple handle.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_APPLE_LINKING","description":"\"Sign in with Apple to verify\" button on the conversionMode: INITIATE interstitial variant.\nShown when the PAP user has Apple auth linked — web and iOS only (Apple unavailable on Android).\nDetermined via userLinkedAuthProvidersDataLoader at render time.\nClient routes to: Web: imdb_apple_linking · iOS: imdb_mobile_ios_apple_linking.\nRAR returns immediateAction: SIGN_IN_WITH_AMAZON_LINKING → zero-UI redirect.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_GOOGLE","description":"3P deprecation interstitial primary button. Web, iOS, and Android.\nReturned on SHOW_3P_DEPRECATION_INTERSTITIAL for imdb_google (web),\nimdb_mobile_ios_google (iOS), and imdb_mobile_android_google (Android).\nClient routes to AuthPortal / MAP SDK with the platform-appropriate Google handle.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_GOOGLE_LINKING","description":"\"Sign in with Google to verify\" button on the conversionMode: INITIATE interstitial variant.\nShown when the PAP user has Google auth linked — all platforms.\nDetermined via userLinkedAuthProvidersDataLoader at render time.\nClient routes to: Web: imdb_google_linking · iOS: imdb_mobile_ios_google_linking · Android: imdb_mobile_android_google_linking.\nRAR returns immediateAction: SIGN_IN_WITH_AMAZON_LINKING → zero-UI redirect.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_IMDB","description":"Redirect user to IMDb sign-in flow.\nClient should navigate to the Sign in with IMDb page/screen.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_IMDB_EMAIL_MATCH_LINKING","description":"Button on the email match conversion interstitial.\nRedirects to the platform-appropriate email match linking association handle\n(imdb_email_match_linking, imdb_mobile_ios_email_match_linking, or\nimdb_mobile_android_email_match_linking). The client navigates to AuthPortal with\nthe Amazon token in the primary cookie — the server resolves the PAP account from\nthe linking cookie and initiates the email match AAP conversion flow.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_IMDB_EMAIL_PREFILLED","description":"Redirect user to IMDb sign-in flow with a prefilled email.\nClient should navigate to the Sign in with IMDb page/screen.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_IMDB_LINKING","description":"\"Sign in to verify\" button on the conversionMode: INITIATE interstitial variant.\nRedirects to the imdb_us_linking association handle. RAR returns SIGN_IN_WITH_AMAZON_LINKING\n(zero-UI). Always shown as the default verify option for all users — no credential check required.\nShown alongside any 3P verify buttons determined by userLinkedAuthProvidersDataLoader.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_LWA","description":"Redirect user to LWA sign-in flow.\nClient should navigate to the Sign in with Amazon page/screen.\nUsed for third-party applications (e.g., IMDb) requiring Amazon authentication.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_PRO_AMAZON_CONVERT_LINKING","description":"\"Sign in with Amazon\" button on the first Pro PAP → AAP conversion interstitial\n(SHOW_PRO_PAP_TO_AAP_CONVERSION). Returned when the user last signed in via an LWA handle.\nClient routes to the imdb_pro_amazon_convert_linking association handle — the Amazon sign-in\nstep where both the \"Sign in with IMDb\" and \"Sign in with Amazon\" Pro conversion paths converge.\nThe \"Sign in with IMDb\" button on the same interstitial reuses the existing\nSIGN_IN_WITH_IMDB_LINKING action.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_OUT","description":"Sign out the current user.\nClient should clear authentication state and return to unauthenticated state.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null}],"possibleTypes":null}},"extensions":{"disclaimer":"Public, commercial, and/or non-private use of the IMDb data provided by this API is not allowed. For limited non-commercial use of IMDb data and the associated requirements see https://help.imdb.com/article/imdb/general-information/can-i-use-imdb-data-in-my-software/G5JTRESSHJBBHTGX#"}}
